---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { CATEGORIES, IMAGES } from '../../data/site.ts';

const title = 'Iranian Export Product Verticals — Saffron, Carpets, Pistachios, Dates, Stone, Petrochemicals | Palude';
const description =
  'Browse all Iranian export verticals: saffron, Persian carpets, pistachios, Mazafati dates and dried fruits, travertine and marble, polyethylene and petrochemicals, and golden almonds. One export desk for the full range of Iranian export goods.';

const collectionSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'CollectionPage',
  name: 'Iranian Export Product Verticals',
  url: 'https://palude.ir/export/',
  description,
  hasPart: CATEGORIES.map((c) => ({
    '@type': 'Product',
    name: c.label,
    url: `https://palude.ir${c.href}`,
  })),
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} jsonLd={collectionSchema}>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Export', href: '/export/' }]} />

  <section class="container-wide py-14 sm:py-20">
    <header class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Export verticals</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-foreground text-balance sm:text-5xl">
        Iranian export product verticals
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/80 text-pretty">
        Seven product verticals, one Iranian export desk. Each vertical links to a detailed sourcing
        page with grade specifications, minimum order quantities, lead times, packaging, and the
        export documentation you will receive.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl prose-palude">
      <p>
        Iran's export economy spans agriculture, handicrafts, industrial minerals and petrochemicals,
        and the international buyer's challenge is rarely finding a supplier — it is finding a
        verified supplier whose grade claim, documentation and logistics match what the buyer's
        destination market requires. The seven verticals below are the categories Palude has built
        its supplier network around, and each vertical page is a working sourcing guide rather than
        a marketing brochure: grade specifications, minimum order quantities, lead times, packaging
        formats, the export documentation you will receive, and the destination-compliance notes
        that determine whether the cargo clears your customs without dispute.
      </p>
      <p>
        The food verticals — <a href="/export/iranian-saffron-super-negin/">saffron</a>,
        <a href="/export/bulk-fandoghi-pistachios-wholesale/">pistachios</a>,
        <a href="/export/mazafati-dates-bulk-import/">dates and dried fruits</a>, and
        <a href="/export/golden-almonds-iran-sourcing/">golden almonds and gift boxes</a> — share a
        common documentation backbone: phytosanitary certification, ISO or HACCP lab certificates,
        and destination-specific food-safety compliance (EU aflatoxin limits, Russian large-importer
        standards, GCC halal certification). The industrial verticals —
        <a href="/export/persian-travertine-marble-supplier/">travertine, marble and bitumen</a> and
        <a href="/export/iranian-polyethylene-film-grade/">polyethylene, methanol and urea</a> —
        share a refinery-certificate and ASTM-spec backbone. The
        <a href="/export/persian-rug-9x12-hand-knotted/">Persian carpet</a> vertical is the outlier,
        with authentication, provenance and Cultural Heritage permits replacing the food and
        chemical certification framework.
      </p>
      <p>
        Buyers running a multi-vertical sourcing programme — for example, a distributor importing
        saffron and pistachios together, or a construction programme importing stone alongside
        petrochemicals — benefit from consolidating the programme through a single export desk. The
        documentation, payment routing and logistics are handled once rather than per-supplier, and
        the per-ton logistics cost falls as the consolidated volume rises. If you are evaluating
        which verticals fit your programme, the detailed pages below are the place to start; if you
        already know your requirement, <a href="/contact/">request a sourcing quote</a> and an
        advisor will respond within one business day.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {CATEGORIES.map((cat) => (
        <a
          href={cat.href}
          class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
            <img
              src={cat.image}
              alt={cat.alt}
              class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
              width="940"
              height="650"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/55 to-transparent"></div>
            <h2 class="absolute bottom-3 left-4 right-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">
              {cat.label}
            </h2>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-5">
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">{cat.blurb}</p>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5">
              {cat.keywords.slice(0, 3).map((kw) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
                  <span class="mt-1 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
                  {kw}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
              Open sourcing guide
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-secondary/60 px-6 py-12 text-center sm:px-12 sm:py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-foreground text-balance sm:text-4xl">
        Not sure which vertical fits your requirement?
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-foreground/75 text-pretty">
        Send us the product, grade, volume and destination port. We respond within one business day
        with verified supplier options and a draft proforma.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-lg bg-primary px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-primary/90 hover:shadow">
        Request a sourcing quote
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
